      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Teachers can\n- see their words on screen within half a second\n- read tidy sentences: fillers removed, terms fixed\n- watch diagrams draw and grow as they explain\n- Draw this, Pin or Dismiss a diagram\n- end the lesson and export it for Padlet\n\nOut of scope\n- real Padlet APIs (export targets are mocked)\n- accounts, several speakers, languages besides English\n\nLimits (assumed)\n- one teacher per lesson\n- diagram within ~4 s of a finished sentence\n- no speech lost while the GPU starts",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1517757225,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
